      "key": "K0093",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 58: from about 15:15 to 17:00 I was at the clinic; around 17:03 I passed through the square; around 17:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:06 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:12 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 21:15 I was at the Lantern; around 21:10 I passed through the square; around 21:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Dunmore house; around 22:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 83002,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
