      "key": "K0152",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 58: from about 15:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:18 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; around 17:16 I passed through the square; around 17:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:06 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 08:00 I was at the mill.",
      "time": 83002,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
