      "key": "K0194",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 58: from about 15:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:16 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 21:15 I was at the Lantern; around 21:14 I passed through the square; around 21:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 21:30 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
