      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 58: from about 15:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 17:00 I was at home; around 17:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:13 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:15 I passed through the square; around 18:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:30 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 19:30 to 20:15 I was at the Brandt house; around 20:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:18 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 21:15 I was at the Kessler house; around 21:14 I passed through the square; around 21:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 21:30 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 08:00 I was at the mill.",
      "time": 83002,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
