      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 58: from about 15:15 to 17:00 I was at home; around 17:06 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:12 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:15 I was at the Lantern; around 23:17 I passed through the square; around 23:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:30 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
